{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123881","id":4651631096,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFUJB-A","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123881","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123881.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123881.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123881","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123881/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123881/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123881/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/773e41d7fcc642b6b867cb614fc934b871a8e350","number":123881,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Update `Node::get_path_to` algorithm","user":{"login":"radioactivejackal1414","id":74024384,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDI0Mzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74024384?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414","html_url":"https://github.com/radioactivejackal1414","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #122411\r\n\r\nThe basic algorithm for `get_path_to` is the same, but I fixed some missed edge cases (calls from an owner node). This PR only modifies behavior for `get_path_to` when called with `use_unique_path == true`.\r\n\r\nIn a sentence:\r\n- If the destination node is unique, and can be accessed using that unique name, `get_path_to` will now always return a path that utilizes the unique name (when called with `use_unique_path == true`).\r\n\r\n## Examples\r\n\r\nTo document what changed, below are all the possible scenarios where `get_path_to` will return a different path than before.\r\n\r\nThe examples below will use the following scene tree:\r\n```\r\nRoot (owner of all other nodes in scene)\r\n`- A1\r\n  `- A2 (can be accessed with unique name prefixed with %)\r\n    `- A3\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Case 1 - Path from an owner to a unique node\r\nThis was the primary problem in the issue.\r\nExample: `Root.get_path_to(A2)`\r\nBefore: `A1/A2`\r\nAfter: `%A2`\r\n\r\n### Case 2 - Path from an owner to a unique node's descendent\r\nIt will now use the unique name so that a shorter path is returned.\r\nExample: `Root.get_path_to(A3)`\r\nBefore: `A1/A2/A3`\r\nAfter: `%A2/A3`\r\n\r\n### Case 3 - Path to an ancestor unique node\r\nIt will now use the unique name instead of a series of `..`\r\nExample: `A3.get_path_to(A2)`\r\nBefore: `..`\r\nAfter: `%A2`\r\nConsider the difference between `GreatGreatGrandchild.get_path_to(UniqueAncestor)` previously returning `../../../..` vs now just returning `%UniqueAncestor`. A shorter path is not always better, but if the method is called with `use_unique_path == true`, the intention is to use the unique name if there is one.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nI used this project (along with a test build where I used a custom `get_path_to_old` method which was the current code for `get_path_to`) to test all imaginable differences:\r\n[unique_names.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32693923/unique_names.zip)\r\n\r\n## Other changes\r\n\r\n- Added a few comments for readability\r\n- Removed redundant code at the beginning of `get_path_to` which was identical to just calling `Node::find_common_parent_with`\r\nedit: typo","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received